{
  "description": "Intergenerational mobility engine — a 5x5 quintile transition matrix whose rows (parent's quintile) the learner edits cell by cell; each edit renormalizes the row and recomputes the immobility, upward-mobility, and rags-to-riches rates, with a perfect-mobility benchmark overlay, on a biology-canvas heat grid. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
